import DifferentialGeometry.Geometry.Collapse.StaticRegisterV4Realization
import DifferentialGeometry.Geometry.Collapse.StaticRegisterV2RowsStrategy

/-!
# Threshold strategies on register V4: infimum, "below", and the 11-row strategy (lane FC39-VAL6)

Register-V4 file (lane FC39-VAL6), generated by `build-logs/scratch/FC39-VAL6/gen_v4.py`
from FC39-VAL5's `StaticRegisterV3RowsStrategy.lean` with register V3 → V4 (`βc` chosen right
after `β₂`, `β₂Up` reads the circle prefix `ClosedCirclePrefixV4` without `βc`; see
`StaticRegisterV4.lean`). It imports no register-V3 module.

* `ClosedThresholdsV4.inf U₁ U₂`: the slotwise minimum of the upper slots and maximum of the lower
  slots (`N_b, c_w, I₁, lpa02V, H` from `U₁`); `ClosedStrategyBelowV4 T U`: every upper slot of `T`
  is below `U`'s, every lower slot above it (no equality clauses);
  `ClosedStrategyRefinesV4.below_VAL6`, `ClosedStrategyBelowV4.trans_VAL6`,
  `ClosedThresholdsV4.inf_below_left_VAL6`, `inf_below_right_VAL6`. A strategy refining
  `U₁.inf U₂` is below both, so each row group is proved for its own strategy and the realization
  refines their infimum.
* `partialRowsStrategyV4 D`, `partialRowOuts_of_below_VAL6`: FC39-VAL4's rows strategy and proof
  (`StaticRegisterV2RowsStrategy.lean`, accepted) transcribed onto register V4 (generated by
  `build-logs/scratch/FC39-VAL5/gen_rows11.py`; the row threshold functions `*_VAL4` are reused):
  at every register of a strategy below it, the conclusions of TCP01, TCP02, EGP03, EGP04, EGP06,
  EGP07, SGP01, SGP02, SGP03, SGP04, SGP06 at the register's values.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

noncomputable section

